  "content": "[Intro]\n[Ebmaj7]  [F]\n[Bb]  [F]  [Gm7]\n[Ebmaj7]  [F/Eb]\n[Ddim]  [Ebdim7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bb]I could hardly believe it When I\n[F/A]heard the news today I\n[Eb/G]had to come and [Ebm/Gb]get it straight from you\n[F]  [F/Eb]  [Bb/D]  [F/C]\n[Bb]They said you were leavin' Someone's\n[F/A]swept your heart away From that\n[Eb/G]look upon your face, [Ebm/Gb]I see it's\n[C/E]true So\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bbsus2]tell me all about it Tell me 'bout the plans you're makin'\n[Eb]Oh,\n[Cm]tell me one thing more [Bb]before [F]I go\n[Bb][F]Tell me\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]how am supposed [F]to live without\n[F]you?\n[Eb]Now that I've been [F]lovin' you so\n[F]long [Ab][Bb]\n[Eb]How am I supposed [F]to live\n[F]without you? And\n[Eb]how am I supposed to carry on?\n[Bbsus2]When\n[Eb]all that I've been livin' for\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Ebmaj7]is gone [F/Eb]\n[Ddim]  [Ebdim7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bb]I'm too proud for cry in' Didn't\n[F/A]come here to break down It's\n[Eb/G]just a dream of mine [Ebm/Gb]is coming to an end\n[F]  [F/Eb]  [Bb/D]  [F/C]\n[Bb]And how can I blame you When I\n[F/A]build my world around The hope\n[Eb/G]that one day We'd be [Ebm/Gb]so much more than\n[C/E]friends\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bbsus2]I don't wanna know the price I'm gonna pay for dream-\n[Eb]ing Oh,\n[Cm]even now it's more [Bb]than [F]I can take\n[Bb][F]Tell me\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]how am supposed [F]to live without\n[F]you?\n[Eb]Now that I've been [F]lovin' you so\n[F]long [Ab][Bb]\n[Eb]How am I supposed [F]to live\n[F]without you? And\n[Eb]how am I supposed to carry on?\n[Bbsus2]When\n[Eb]all that I've been livin' for is\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[Bb]gone [Dm]\n[Eb]  [F]\n[Gm]  [Eb]\n[F]\n[Bb]  [Dm]\n[Eb]  [F]\n[Gm]  [Am7]\n[Gb]Now\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bsus2]I don't wanna know the price I'm gonna pay for dream-\n[E]ing Oh,\n[C#m]now that your [B]dream [F#]has come true\n[B][F#]Tell me\n\n[Chorus]\n[E]how am supposed [F#]to live without\n[F#]you?\n[E]Now that I've been [F#]lovin' you so\n[F#]long [A][B]\n[E]How am I supposed [F#]to live\n[F#]without you?\n[E]And how am I supposed to carry\n[Bsus2]on? When\n[E]all that I've been livin' for\n\n[Outro]\n[E7M]is gone [Gb7/E]\n[B/D#]  [C#m]\n[D#m7]",
